  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARUS - Assisting Regional Universities in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The long-term objective of the ARUS program is uptake and influence of ARUS-supported development research in public policies, debates and development projects. The programme will build research capacity for staff through training and collaborative research activities in seven regional universities in Sudan. Academic staff will produce new and relevant research on local and regional development in collaboration with Norwegian researchers.</narrative>
  </description>
